### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Root endpoint
GET http://localhost:8000/

### List registered strategies
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/strategies

### Test price update event for specific market
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/events/price-updated/KRW-BTC

### Test price update event for another market
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/events/price-updated/KRW-ETH

### Get market chart data (debugging)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/markets/KRW-BTC/data

### Test with invalid market
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/events/price-updated/INVALID-MARKET
